{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdLrhGqaCQrUQgramS645","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01PTqAWHA3NfqwfHFziyWwDc","name":"mcp__workflow__worker_turn","input":{"runId":"run-20260724-120458-4780","role":"worker","nickname":"worker","scope":"task-launch-architecture-diagnosis.md","task":"task-launch-architecture-diagnosis.md. Requested by: planner. Execution mode: diagnosis. Identifies current task launch mechanism in Rails, how artifacts are currently stored/distributed, how workers receive execution context and files, and specifies the architectural changes needed to support artifact propagation from task launch to spawned workers","result":"[DONE] Diagnosis complete. Full architecture traced and documented: task launches via LaunchRunJob → SpawnRequest → WorkerSpawner → Worker process. Artifacts stored in filesystem at .workflow-orchestrator/artifacts/<run_id>/. Worker context propagated through enriched prompts (worker identity + workspace memory) and MCP tools (get_run_context, read_workflow_artifact, write_workflow_artifact). Confirmed: artifact propagation from task launch to spawned workers is not yet implemented. No mechanism exists for declaring produced artifacts, inheriting from parent workers, or validating availability before spawning. Proposed 9 architectural changes documented in artifact.","evidenceOutcome":"confirmed","evidenceCitations":["artifact propagation from task launch to spawned workers is not yet implemented","there is no mechanism for: 1. Declaring which artifacts should be available to a newly spawned worker 2. Passing artifact references through the task launch pipeline 3. Automatically inheriting or propagating artifacts from parent workers to child workers","The task is stored in two places: `Run.task` (the model) and `SpawnRequest.text` (the request)","Artifacts are stored as **flat files** in the workspace filesystem: <workspace_root>/.workflow-orchestrator/artifacts/<run_id>/<artifact_name>","The ops hub UI discovers artifacts from three sources: SpawnRequest.where(run_id: @run.run_id).pluck(:scope) + Array(@latest_tick&.dig(\"followingSteps\")).map + Orchestrator::ArtifactStore.names","This is pull-based discovery. There is no push mechanism for a spawned worker to declare \"I inherit artifacts A, B, C\" and have the system automatically make them available to its child workers.","**No access control enforced** — any worker can read any artifact in its run","**The worker can only write to `artifactName === worker.scope`**","The `SpawnRequest` model currently has: scope, text, context. It does **NOT** have: required_artifacts or inherited_artifacts, artifact_references, or artifact_inheritance_mode"]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3022,"cache_read_input_tokens":70717,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3022},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"757edfd5-1b3c-4393-821f-d3674027460e","uuid":"504adfe9-b294-4ca1-9ea0-18129f758e7a","timestamp":"2026-07-24T12:09:38.606Z","request_id":"req_011CdLrh4iKRf23cXjDizxM2","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01PTqAWHA3NfqwfHFziyWwDc","display_name":"Worker Turn","server_display_name":"workflow-worker"}]}
