{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdLrj6n916DQ7wsxBSwAe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[DONE] Diagnosis task completed successfully.\n\n**Summary:**\n\nI have completed a comprehensive diagnosis of the Rails task launch architecture and artifact distribution system. Key findings:\n\n1. **Current Task Launch**: Tasks are successfully launched via `LaunchRunJob` → `SpawnRequest` → `WorkerSpawner` → Worker processes. Worker context is propagated through enriched prompts (containing identity info and workspace memory) and MCP tools.\n\n2. **Artifact Storage**: Artifacts are stored as flat files in `.workflow-orchestrator/artifacts/<run_id>/` with safety checks preventing directory traversal. The `ArtifactStore` service handles filesystem I/O, while access control is enforced at the MCP tool level.\n\n3. **Current Limitation**: **Artifact propagation from task launch to spawned workers is not yet implemented.** There is no mechanism for:\n   - Declaring which artifacts a worker produces\n   - Inheriting artifacts from parent workers\n   - Validating artifact availability before spawning\n   - Discovering available artifacts efficiently\n\n4. **Proposed Solution**: 9 architectural changes documented, including:\n   - Extend `SpawnRequest` with `required_artifacts`, `inherited_artifacts`, and `artifact_inheritance_chain` fields\n   - Update prompt construction to include artifact metadata\n   - Add `producedArtifacts` support to `worker_turn` RPC\n   - Implement planner integration for automatic artifact inheritance\n   - Add `collect_artifacts` MCP tool for worker-side discovery\n\nThe full diagnosis with implementation guidance, acceptance criteria, and evidence citations has been written to the artifact: **task-launch-architecture-diagnosis.md**\n\nThe planner has been notified and will proceed with the next steps."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":814,"cache_read_input_tokens":75639,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":814},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"757edfd5-1b3c-4393-821f-d3674027460e","uuid":"15640c35-1195-43ac-803d-8c452dae8f1e","timestamp":"2026-07-24T12:09:58.548Z","request_id":"req_011CdLrj59v1yRSvKijNYQci"}
